{title: Mighty Warriors}
{subtitle: 1 Chronicles 7:7; 7:6–7}
{key: D#m}
{tempo: 85}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [D#m] | ×9

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Bela son of Benjamin stands
With Becher and Jediael [F#]three
[B]From Jacob [C#]youngest son came [D#m]forth
The [B]tribe [C#]of Benjamin we [D#m]see
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Ezbon [C#]Uzzi [D#m]Uzziel too
Jeri[C#]moth and Iri [F#]five
[B]Heads of [C#]fathers houses [D#m]they were
[B]Counted in the [C#]record [D#m]given
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Mighty [B]warriors [C#]strong and [D#m]true
Twen-ty-[B]two thousand [C#]thir-ty-[F#]four
Regis[B]tered in the [C#]line of [D#m]men
From [B]the fami[C#]ly of [D#m]Bela
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Iri [C#]stands a[D#m]mong the five
A son of [C#]Bela by [F#]name
[B]Part of the [C#]twelve tribes [D#m]list
[B]His place [C#]in history re[D#m]mains
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Mig[B]hty warriors [C#]strong and [D#m]true
Twen-ty-[B]two thousand [C#]thir-ty-[F#]four
Regis[B]tered in the [C#]line of [D#m]men
From [B]the fami[C#]ly of [D#m]Bela
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[B]Heads of [C#]their fa[D#m]thers houses
[B]Mighty [C#]warriors named [F#]Iri
[B]Counted in [C#]the ge[D#m]nealogy
Of [B]Benja[C#]min the tribe of [D#m]God
{end_of_verse}
